    "description": "The Inventory Management API facilitates the retrieval of product inventory data, providing businesses with crucial insights into stock levels and availability. This endpoint allows users to access detailed information about their inventory items, which is essential for sales forecasting and supply chain management. Typical consumers of this API include e-commerce platforms, retailers, and supply chain managers who require real-time inventory tracking to optimize operations. By integrating this API, businesses can ensure they maintain adequate stock and improve customer satisfaction.",
